From 40ce24e01f05ca1847e9cd3c2048a28a291b68a6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Emil <emil.grotta@colorado.edu>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 07:33:00 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] feat(web): optional per-thread tokens/sec readout

Shows the last finished turn's average output tokens per second next to the
context-window meter. Off by default; the toggle lives in the meter popover and
is remembered per thread on this client. The rate comes only from a complete
provider-reported main-agent token total and the turn's wall time, so
providers that report nothing (or only partial totals, or subagent turns) show
no readout instead of an estimate.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
